<title>PatrickScript — a language designed by an LLM under two constraints</title>
<meta name="description" content="PatrickScript is a Turing-complete stack language designed end-to-end by an LLM agent, given only two constraints: a name (PatrickScript) and a two-token alphabet — the word 'patrick' and a single space.">
<meta property="og:title" content="PatrickScript">
<meta property="og:description" content="A programming language designed end-to-end by an LLM agent, given only two constraints: a name and a two-token alphabet.">
